              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Deidrel"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've fallen back on this recipe more than once this winter, and was happy with it each time. The spices aren't too strong, especially with the sweetness of the carrot. I didn't find it necessary to use oil when I cooked the lentils and vegetables in water on the stove instead of in the pressure cooker."
