            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Buckwheat Queen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was weary of the onion soup flavour mixed with, in essence, pumpkin spice flavour. In fact, I didn't care for it. I tried to adjust by adding some roasted pumpkin then added some firm tofu. Texture is a plus for me, because it gets nice and thick. I added some stock the next day to thin out the leftovers. In the end, I'd make this again but would cut the \"pumpkin spice\".",
            "datePublished": "2015-10-28T05:22:31.830Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
