            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FLUTTERBY1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very warm flavors, and very tasty but just a bit sweet. The sweetness is similar to that of a squash soup. We added some dried red pepper flakes to give it a kick at the end. Would be good garnished with some toasted sage leaves.",
